      "rows": [
        [
          "5",
          "I think the skills of working in a group will become more important in the future. By\nworking in a group, people can help each other and finish difficult tasks that are too\nhard to do alone. Who started the cleaning event? Is the cleaning event held every\nyear?"
        ],
        [
          "6",
          "Yes, I think so. First, robots that can do housework save time for families. Families can\nfocus on talking, playing, and eating together instead of doing housework. Second,\nsome robots can carry or lift heavy things. This is especially helpful for older people or\nparents with small children, since they may have difficulty doing such tasks."
        ]
      ]
    },
