        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "eikenp2-2026-round1-gakka-q31",
      "officialQuestionLabel": "ライティング 6",
      "sourcePage": 11,
      "questionSha256": "fa43dd4bb1c82d1b3fdb724b5ad0ca7be47de7a4f4a3dd220879c4392ddaef0c",
      "officialAnswerNumber": null,
      "modelAnswer": "Yes, I think so. First, robots that can do housework save time for families. Families can focus on talking, playing, and eating together instead of doing housework. Second, some robots can carry or lift heavy things. This is especially helpful for older people or parents with small children, since they may have difficulty doing such tasks.",
      "originalContentSha256": "57f21306777d85d91a6746a082295c1ac33941d5a22190ae89bc41818605a8e6",
